{"ts": "2026-09-27T07:25:43Z", "id": "polymarket:1027446@2026-09-27T07:25:43Z", "event": "polymarket:1027446", "keys": ["polymarket:4581768", "polymarket:4581765"], "mids": {"polymarket:4581768": 0.515, "polymarket:4581765": 0.255}, "raw_facts": [{"kind": "schedule", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Sports Mole", "url": "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "fact": "Belgium host France on Monday, 28 September 2026 at 20:45 local time (18:45 UTC) at the King Baudouin Stadium in Brussels. It is matchday 2 of League A Group 1 in the 2026/27 UEFA Nations League."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-25", "source": "beIN SPORTS", "url": "https://www.beinsports.com/en-mena/football/uefa-nations-league/articles-video/mbappe-scores-but-suffers-knee-injury-as-zidane-gets-debut-france-win-2026-09-25", "fact": "France won 1-0 away to Turkey in their Nations League opener, Zinedine Zidane's first game as France coach. Kylian Mbapp\u00e9 scored the winner in the 55th minute, set up by Michael Olise, but hurt his left knee moments later."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "ESPN", "url": "https://www.espn.com/soccer/story/_/id/50029181/mbappe-exits-knee-injury-scoring-france-zidane-debut", "fact": "Mbapp\u00e9 is leaving the France camp and will miss the rest of the international window, including the Belgium match. Real Madrid diagnosed an overstretching of the posterior capsule of his left knee. Zidane said: 'he is going to have to go home. We don't want to take any risks.'"}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Sports Mole", "url": "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "fact": "Belgium won their opener 2-0 against Italy, with goals from Mika Godts and Dodi Lukebakio. It was Belgium's first clean sheet in five matches."}, {"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Yahoo Sports", "url": "https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/preview-belgium-vs-france-team-185000175.html", "fact": "After matchday 1, Belgium and France both have 3 points. Belgium are 1st in the group and France 2nd."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Sports Mole", "url": "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "fact": "Belgium have lost each of their last five meetings with France, a run going back to June 2015."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Sports Mole", "url": "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "fact": "Belgium are unbeaten in 9 home games against all opponents since November 2024 (6 wins, 3 draws)."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Sports Mole", "url": "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "fact": "France have won 8 and drawn 1 of their last 9 away matches."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "11v11", "url": "https://www.11v11.com/teams/belgium/tab/opposingTeams/opposition/France/", "fact": "The all-time record, from Belgium's side, is 30 wins, 19 draws and 25 losses against France, with 160 goals scored and 128 conceded. In the last 6 meetings France won 5 and Belgium 1, with no draws."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "11v11", "url": "https://www.11v11.com/teams/belgium/tab/opposingTeams/opposition/France/", "fact": "Recent meetings include France 2-0 Belgium in the Nations League on 2024-09-09. The most recent meeting was a 3-2 France win over Belgium."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Sports Mole", "url": "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "fact": "Belgium are without Leandro Trossard (heel injury). Apart from Mbapp\u00e9, France have no reported absentees."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Yahoo Sports", "url": "https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/preview-belgium-vs-france-team-185000175.html", "fact": "Both teams have new coaches. Mark van Bommel took over Belgium on 15 August, replacing Rudi Garcia, who had taken Belgium to the 2026 World Cup quarter-finals. Zidane replaced Didier Deschamps as France coach after 14 years, and the Belgium match is his second game in charge."}, {"kind": "rules", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "Question resolution rules", "url": "https://www.uefa.com/uefanationsleague/news/02a2-1fea5720f002-0f82761894aa-1000--2026-27-uefa-nations-league-games-to-look-out-for/", "fact": "Only the result after 90 minutes plus stoppage time counts. A draw resolves both the France and Belgium questions as 'No'."}], "source_urls": ["https://dossiers.dhnet.be/ligue-des-nations/", "https://en.fifaranking.net/nations/bel/results/head-to-head/index.php?team=fra", "https://en.fifaranking.net/nations/fra/results/head-to-head/index.php?team=bel", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026%E2%80%9327_in_Turkish_football", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Men%27s_FIH_Hockey_World_Cup", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miss_France_2027", "https://fbref.com/en/stathead/matchup/teams/b1b36dcd/361422b9/France-vs-Belgium-History", "https://footystats.org/international/belgium-national-team-vs-france-national-team-h2h-stats", "https://globalsportsarchive.com/en/soccer/match/2026-09-28/belgium-vs-france/4095487", "https://gulfnews.com/sport/football/kylian-mbappe-left-out-of-france-squad-for-nations-league-games-1.104285491", "https://khelnow.com/football/world-football-france-vs-belgium-head-to-head-record-euro-202406", "https://m.aiscore.com/head-to-head/basketball/belgium-vs-france", "https://m.aiscore.com/head-to-head/soccer-belgium-vs-france", "https://merkur.com/en/sportsbetting/news/uefa-nations-league-matchday-predictions-for-2026-27-%E2%80%93-matchdays-1-and-2.html", "https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/preview-belgium-vs-france-team-185000175.html", "https://tips.gg/article/belgium-vs-france-predicted-lineups-team-news-2026/", "https://ua.news/en/sport/zidan-debiutuvav-peremogoiu-mbappe-travmuvavsia-the-national", "https://www.11v11.com/teams/belgium/tab/opposingTeams/opposition/France/", "https://www.beinsports.com/en-mena/football/uefa-nations-league/articles-video/mbappe-scores-but-suffers-knee-injury-as-zidane-gets-debut-france-win-2026-09-25", "https://www.cbssports.com/soccer/news/injured-kylian-mbappe-out-for-france-vs-portugal-in-nations-league", "https://www.espn.com/soccer/match/_/gameId/401861081/france-belgium", "https://www.espn.com/soccer/story/_/id/50029181/mbappe-exits-knee-injury-scoring-france-zidane-debut", "https://www.fotmob.com/matches/france-vs-belgium/1uv3r2", "https://www.fotmob.com/teams/6723/overview/france", "https://www.foxsports.com/soccer/nations-league-belgium-vs-france-sep-28-2026-game-boxscore-688973", "https://www.freetips.com/football/belgium-vs-france-tips-20260926-0018/", "https://www.goal.com/en/news/lucky-escape-for-kylian-mbappe-real-madrid-announce-diagnosis-on-the-superstar-s-injury/blt5663c54b882afb8e", "https://www.goal.com/en/news/tendon-injury-real-star-kylian-mbappe-forced-off-injured-after-scoring-for-france/blt52b1f57f12cf47e2", "https://www.mightytips.com/football-predictions/belgium-vs-france-prediction-28-09-2026/", "https://www.nbcsports.com/soccer/news/kylian-mbappe-injury-news-latest-update-on-france-real-madrid-superstar", "https://www.pressreader.com/usa/the-guardian-usa/20220611/282376928233046", "https://www.sportskeeda.com/football/belgium-vs-france-prediction-betting-tips-september-28th-2026", "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "https://www.stubhub.com/belgium-national-football-team-brussels-tickets-9-28-2026/event/161441318/", "https://www.thenationalnews.com/sport/2026/09/26/mbappe-injury-blow-for-zidane-mancinis-nightmare-return-and-isak-on-target-in-nations-league/", "https://www.thescore.com/natleaguea/event/96872", "https://www.thesoccerworldcups.com/head_to_head/france_vs_belgium.php", "https://www.uefa.com/uefanationsleague/news/02a2-1fea5720f002-0f82761894aa-1000--2026-27-uefa-nations-league-games-to-look-out-for/"], "meta": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "api_equivalent_usd": 0.24978, "searches": 4, "fetches": 2, "turns": 7, "latency_ms": 59144, "billing": "claude_plan"}}
{"ts": "2026-09-27T07:25:43Z", "id": "polymarket:45915@2026-09-27T07:25:43Z", "event": "polymarket:45915", "keys": ["polymarket:601819", "polymarket:601826"], "mids": {"polymarket:601819": 0.435, "polymarket:601826": 0.572}, "raw_facts": [{"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-23", "source": "Reuters via US News (AtlasIntel/Bloomberg poll)", "url": "https://www.usnews.com/news/world/articles/2026-09-23/brazils-lula-flavio-bolsonaro-remain-tied-in-runoff-scenario-atlas-poll-shows", "fact": "AtlasIntel/Bloomberg surveyed 5,015 people from Sept 17\u201322 (margin \u00b11 pt). Runoff: Lula 47.7%, Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro 47.4%. First round: Lula 45.8%, Fl\u00e1vio 43.4%, Renan Santos 4.5%, Augusto Cury 2.1%, Ronaldo Caiado 1.3%."}, {"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-25", "source": "Al Jazeera (Datafolha poll)", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/25/brazils-lula-and-flavio-bolsonaro-still-essentially-tied-in-new-poll", "fact": "Datafolha poll from Sept 22\u201323: runoff Lula 47%, Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro 45%, within the \u00b12 pt margin. First round: Lula 40%, Fl\u00e1vio 36%, Cury 5%, Caiado 4%, Santos 3%. A BTG Pactual/Nexus poll had the runoff at Lula 46%, Fl\u00e1vio 45%."}, {"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-21", "source": "Rio Times / Reuters (Quaest poll)", "url": "https://www.riotimesonline.com/brazil-election-quaest-poll-flavio-42-lula-41-runoff-september-2026/", "fact": "Quaest poll released Sept 21: runoff Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro 42%, Lula 41%, inside the 2-pt margin of error. The same series had it at 42\u201340 a week earlier."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-07", "source": "Reuters via US News (Quaest/Globo poll)", "url": "https://www.usnews.com/news/world/articles/2026-09-07/lula-flavio-bolsonaro-tied-in-brazils-election-runoff-quaest-poll-shows", "fact": "Quaest/Globo poll published Sept 7 had Lula and Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro tied at 41% each in a runoff scenario."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-03", "source": "Gazeta do Povo (Datafolha poll)", "url": "https://www.gazetadopovo.com.br/eleicoes/2026/pesquisa-eleitoral-2026/datafolha-presidente-setembro-2026/", "fact": "Datafolha poll of 2,002 respondents, Sept 1\u20133: first round Lula 38%, Fl\u00e1vio 32%. Runoff Lula 46%, Fl\u00e1vio 44%. So between early and late September, Datafolha's first-round numbers went from 38\u201332 to 40\u201336, and the runoff from 46\u201344 to 47\u201345."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-08-15", "source": "Al Jazeera (Quaest poll)", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/8/15/lula-holds-slim-lead-over-flavio-bolsonaro-ahead-of-brazil-election", "fact": "Quaest poll from Aug 10\u201313 (2,004 people, commissioned by Globo): runoff Lula 43%, Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro 40%. By Sept 21, Quaest showed Fl\u00e1vio ahead 42\u201341."}, {"kind": "schedule", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "Wikipedia \u2013 2026 Brazilian general election", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Brazilian_general_election", "fact": "First round is Oct 4, 2026. If no candidate gets more than 50% of valid votes, the top two go to a runoff on Oct 25, 2026. The registered candidates include Lula (PT, running mate Alckmin), Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro (PL), Caiado (PSD), Zema (NOVO), Cury (Avante), Renan Santos (Miss\u00e3o) and five minor-party candidates."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-15", "source": "Wikipedia \u2013 2026 Brazilian general election", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Brazilian_general_election", "fact": "From Sept 1\u201315, tensions grew around Supreme Court Justice Alexandre de Moraes after messages suggested improper closeness to banker Daniel Vorcaro. The Banco Master scandal and the INSS fraud scheme have dominated campaign coverage, touching people across party lines."}, {"kind": "rules", "date": "2026-09-23", "source": "Reuters via US News", "url": "https://www.usnews.com/news/world/articles/2026-09-23/brazils-lula-flavio-bolsonaro-remain-tied-in-runoff-scenario-atlas-poll-shows", "fact": "A first-round win requires more than 50% of valid votes; blank and null votes are excluded. Otherwise the top two meet in the Oct 25 runoff, and the question counts the runoff result."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2022-10-30", "source": "Wikipedia \u2013 Brazilian presidential elections", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Brazilian_general_election", "fact": "Since re-election was allowed in 1997, 3 of 4 sitting presidents who ran again won: Cardoso in 1998, Lula in 2006 and Rousseff in 2014. Jair Bolsonaro lost to Lula in 2022, 50.9% to 49.1% in the runoff."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2022-10-02", "source": "Wikipedia \u2013 Opinion polling for the 2022 Brazilian presidential election", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opinion_polling_for_the_2022_Brazilian_presidential_election", "fact": "In the 2022 first round, final polls understated Jair Bolsonaro. Datafolha's last valid-vote poll had about Lula 50% vs Bolsonaro 36%; the actual result was Lula 48.4% vs Bolsonaro 43.2%."}, {"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-19", "source": "JOTA (Palver poll)", "url": "https://www.jota.info/eleicoes/eleicoes-2026/lula-lidera-primeiro-turno-mas-empata-com-flavio-bolsonaro-no-segundo-aponta-palver", "fact": "A Palver poll had Lula leading the first round and tied with Fl\u00e1vio in the runoff. Both have high rejection rates: 52% for Lula and 51% for Fl\u00e1vio."}], "source_urls": ["https://amp.cbc.ca/lite/story/1.6634169", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Brazilian_general_election", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Rio_de_Janeiro_general_election", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opinion_polling_for_the_2022_Brazilian_presidential_election", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opinion_polling_for_the_2026_Brazilian_presidential_election", "https://euronews.com/2022/10/29/brazil-election-bolsonaro-and-lula-clash-in-last-tv-debate-before-sundays-vote", "https://globalnews.ca/news/9236818/bolsonaro-lula-presidential-election-brazil-polls", "https://iecofin.su